### 3.2. 将上面构造出的 token 列表构造成`树形模板AST`

实现一个 `parse` 函数，即将 `上面的token 列表`输出为如下`树结构`，如下结构就是 `AST` 或者说是 `Vnode`

![图片](https://832-1310531898.cos.ap-beijing.myqcloud.com/999.%20Obsidian@832/files/20241104-19.png)

```json
{
    "type": "Root",
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "Element",
            "tag": "div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "Element",
                    "tag": "p",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "Text",
                            "content": "Vue"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "Element",
                    "tag": "p",
                    "children": [
