## 6. 空间复杂度降为 `O(1)`

```typescript
// 进一步优化，把二维的dp table 压成一维的,即只要维护两个变量 prev  curr
function fib (n) {
  if (n === 0 || n === 1) return n;
  let prev = 1, curr = 1;

  for (let i = 2; i < n; i++) {
    let sum = prev + curr;
    prev = curr;
    curr = sum;
  }

  return curr;
};
```

