```javascript
function fn(...skus) {
  let n = skus.length;
  let res = [];
  function backtrack(track, idx) {
    if (track.length === n) {
      res.push([...track]);
      return;
    }
    let opts = skus[idx];
    for (let item of opts) {
      track.push(item);
      backtrack(track, idx + 1);
      track.pop();
    }
  }
  backtrack([], 0);
  return res;
}
```

## 2. 分析

 - 参数：
	 - `backtrack = (路径, 选择列表, index)`
		 - 路径
		 - 选择列表
		 - index 
			 - 额外的参数，代表选中第几种规格


```javascript hl:20
